why: gw-monolith-decompose, fourth slice. Sessions = 22 items / 387 lines but calls 10 helpers,
     so the shared layer goes first (the ordering that has kept every module pointing downward).
     Measured: those helpers call exactly one thing outside themselves (agent_on_path), which
     comes with them.
trap: "session" means TWO things in this file — a tmux terminal session and an auth login
      session. `sess_path` is ucc-auth-sessions.json and belongs to auth, NOT here; grouping by
      the word would have merged them.
